DESCRIPTION:Vegetable baskets year-round! Each year\, households commit t
 o picking up a weekly basket of vegetables and building local food sover
 eignty. It's our CSA—our Community Supported Agriculture. The basket c
 ontains a carefully chosen mix of classic vegetables and exciting flavor
  discoveries\, grown without synthetic fertilizers\, pesticides\, herbic
 ides\, or fossil fuel machinery\, but with plenty of love.\nhttps://chec
 hette.be/events/17h-19h-paniers-bio-ferme-de-nadir/
