SUMMARY:Once Upon a Time There Was a Miller's Daughter…
LOCATION:Het Goudblommeke in Papier
URL:https://goudblommekeinpapier.be/event/er-was-eens-een-molenaarsdochte
 r/
DESCRIPTION:On the significance of mills and millers in legends and fairy
  tales. Sunday\, November 1\, 2026 at 3pm. At Het Goudblommeke in Papier
 \, Cellebroerstraat 55\, 1000 Brussels. When mills were still a natural 
 sight on the horizon\, the image of the mill and the miller became deepl
 y ingrained in people's minds and found expression in popular culture. I
 n fairy tales\, folk songs\, legends and proverbs\, the mill became a mu
 ltifaceted symbol. The miller also evolved into a fascinating\, archetyp
 al figure with many guises. Dive into this wondrous world of mill lore w
 here ingenuity and imagination...\nhttps://goudblommekeinpapier.be/event
 /er-was-eens-een-molenaarsdochter/
