URL:https://cbcs.be/event/prendre-soin-des-liens-babelzin-fete-ses-5-ans/
DESCRIPTION:NURTURING CONNECTIONS: CLINIC\, SOCIAL ECOLOGY AND MENTAL HEA
 LTH Caring for mental health is not just about treating individuals\; it
 's also about caring for human environments\, institutions and the share
 d world in which subjectivities are formed. For five years\, Babel'zin h
 as been committed to the idea that a space for meeting\, conversation an
 d shared presence is already an essential response to certain forms of c
 ontemporary suffering. In a society marked by isolation\, accelerated li
 ving rhythms\, fragmented life paths and growing fragility\nhttps://cbcs
 .be/event/prendre-soin-des-liens-babelzin-fete-ses-5-ans/
